  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "After Fairy You Chan agrees to cooperate on iron dragonfish, Qin Bai He, owner of white crane sea area and one of Eastern Sea’s six beauties, names her empress of Bai He Palace; You Chan stays inside the house while they work, and more than ten days later an iron dragonfish appears there.",
      "chapters": [
        1483
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_you_chan",
        "char_qin_bai_he",
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page is filed under gu-houses because Bai He Palace is a named Immortal Gu House. It is mobile household equipment in Eastern Sea, not a five-region map seat.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_immortal_gu_house"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After killing Qin Bai He and You Chan in dragonfish sea area, Fang Yuan rushes to white crane sea area for Bai He Palace, which Qin Bai He left behind to defend that sea area. Using familiar face as Qin Bai He, he enters, captures her leftover will, and spends a day and night with wisdom path Immortal Gu and methods to gain ownership, now his own Immortal Gu House. The house is incomplete, low in power, and uses two rank six Immortal Gu as cores; it was designed to house her concubines, is fragile, and is far weaker than Hei tribe’s Dark Prison. He memorizes its structure, then disassembles it for Gu worms, including a wood path Immortal Gu and food path Eat Fragrance, and kills the concubines while keeping their souls. Bai He blessed land’s land spirit condition involves Bai He Palace; Fang Yuan ignores that condition and suppresses the land spirit instead.",
      "chapters": [
        1487
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ownership-and-cores",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "move_familiar_face",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "fac_hei_tribe",
        "house_dark_prison",
        "sys_gu_worms",
        "gu_eat_fragrance_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qing Yue Zhi Cheng searches white crane sea area after the robbery and cannot find the rank six Immortal Gu House Bai He Palace, nor Qin Bai He, nor any battle traces.",
      "chapters": [
        1488
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "qing-yue-search",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qing_yue_zhi_cheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan builds an incomplete Immortal Gu House so Hei Lou Lan, Bai Ning Bing, and others can fight with him, he takes reference from Bai He Palace among many other Immortal Gu Houses, with the skeleton based on Graceful Chaotic Duel Stage.",
      "chapters": [
